oiler":false,"text":"男子の視線を浴び、ちやほやされることを当然と思っている小悪魔的美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だが実は性的なことに関してはほとんど免疫が無い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ一人戦い続けている凛々子を尊敬し、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦えないでいる香那葉を蔑むような態度をとる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"96138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa27aef812e86430ee6638e91d8b73a5ed2b68f738d3655a81e4a8167e434e2d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4ef9d876ac526c544240eef078ae735a2da2ecaf1b0e88ed31d2fe2305d6cd1.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c53362","characterName":"メッツァー・ハインケル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"96152","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"222233"},{"characterId":"96152","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"222242"}],"egsCharacterIds":["988"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53362"},"originalCharacterName":"メッツァー・ハインケル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"1","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"公式情報なし"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"公式情報なし"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"egs","value":"男性"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"今作のプレイヤーキャラクター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変身ヒロインを快楽責めで篭絡する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘では後方より間接的に支援する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"988","sourceWorkId":"10418","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ロアの半分を掌中に、一気に女神近衛団の殲滅を謀るべく、ある計画を進行中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その一環として地上に再臨した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで出会ったレムティアシータを手に入れるべく、自ら戦闘・調教に出向く。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"988","sourceWorkId":"11289","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界の王となるべく、立ちはだかる魔法戦士たちを謀略と快楽を以て籠絡していく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCh